sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as React Students Page
    participant API as Express Student API
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant DB as MongoDB
    Admin->>UI: Submit student form
    UI->>API: POST /api/students + Bearer JWT
    API->>Auth: Verify token
    Auth-->>API: Authenticated user ID
    API->>API: Validate request body
    alt invalid data
      API-->>UI: 400 validation errors
      UI-->>Admin: Display field/form error
    else valid data
      API->>DB: Insert Student with createdBy
      DB-->>API: Saved document
      API-->>UI: 201 created student
      UI->>API: GET /api/students
      API->>DB: Query records for owner
      DB-->>API: Student list
      API-->>UI: 200 list + pagination
      UI-->>Admin: Render updated table
    end
